Z||000000||gt boy||09-04-2001||10:17 PM||||well...will they fit??<P>i am quite partial to the polished five spoke wheels that came on the most recent grand prix's||||reg||1
Z||000001||Rick 88||09-04-2001||10:34 PM||||The Grand Prix wheels are not the same bolt pattern as the Fiero's 5x100. There are similar style wheels in the aftermarket. Pontiac made a twisted 5 spoke 97 Grand Am GT 16 in wheel that will fit and looks good. 98 on up Grand Am (N body) wheels use a larger bolt pattern and won't fit.<P>Rick<BR>yellow 88 GT 5-speed||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula88||09-05-2001||01:11 AM||||The Grand Am wheels changed in 99.  98's have a 5x100 and 99+ has the 5x115mm bolt pattern.||||reg||1
Z||000003||gt boy||09-05-2001||10:21 PM||||thanks for the reply ...but do you know what the width of the grand am wheels are?<P>||||reg||1
Z||000004||rogergarrison||09-05-2001||10:49 PM||||most OEM wheels are 6-7 inches||||reg||1
